usage: repropatch [-h] [--version] {doctor,validate-task,run} ...

Reproducible C++ repair harness

positional arguments:
  {doctor,validate-task,run}
    doctor              Check host tools and local Docker image
    validate-task       Validate task YAML without executing code
    run                 Reproduce, repair, independently verify

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
